{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-04-19 16:15:00', 'title': 'DESTACO EXPANDS ITS MANUAL CLAMP PRODUCT OFFERINGS', 'text': 'NEW AND UPGRADED MODELS OFFER MORE FLEXIBILITY FOR USERS IN WORKHOLDING APPLICATIONS DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , APRIL 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ – DESTACO, PART OF DOVER (NYSE: DOV), ANNOUNCED THAT IT CONTINUES TO EXPAND THE OPTIONS WITHIN ITS MANUAL CLAMP PRODUCT FAMILY THROUGH THE CREATION OF NEW MODELS AND THE UPGRADE OF EXISTING VERSIONS.'}